{"4354610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tamas: Shadowveil", "steam_appid": 4354610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Greed or Dread: Which will claim you first?​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tamas: Shadowveil</strong> is a first-person PvPvE extraction game set in a dark world inspired by Chinese folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter haunted ruins armed with cold steel. Search for valuable relics, fight supernatural creatures and rival players, and escape before everything you brought in—and everything you found—is lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT KIND OF GAME IS IT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a blight-stricken region alongside other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned settlements, search buildings for lost treasures, and fight anything standing between you and the extraction point—whether human, supernatural, or something in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape successfully, and everything you collect is yours to keep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fall before you make it out, and you lose everything you carried into the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no shrinking circles. The only way to win is to find a way out alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHINESE FOLK HORROR BROUGHT TO LIFE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper figures that move when you look away. Creatures hidden within the firelight. Something behind the door. Something above the rafters. Something beneath the water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of threats inspired by Chinese folk tales and supernatural legends now roam the land—and none of them intend to let you leave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/9def7cf72d40a80ef09f83e647c40bbc.poster.avif?t=1787139131\" width=832 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/9def7cf72d40a80ef09f83e647c40bbc.webm?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/9def7cf72d40a80ef09f83e647c40bbc.mp4?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMMERSIVE EXPLORATION IN FORBIDDEN LAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with Unreal Engine 5, <strong>Tamas: Shadowveil</strong> brings its unsettling world to life through richly detailed environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore crumbling ancestral halls, moonlit abandoned villages, deserted opera stages, and manor corridors lit by fading lanterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are more than combat arenas. Every location holds traces of what happened there, and every detail may be a clue—or a warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/a9429d3eec5e2f6a022617928c5728e1.poster.avif?t=1787139131\" width=832 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/a9429d3eec5e2f6a022617928c5728e1.webm?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/a9429d3eec5e2f6a022617928c5728e1.mp4?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RISK IT ALL FOR RARE RELICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region is filled with valuable relics and hidden treasures waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill your pack. Search one more room. Push deeper for a better haul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greatest rewards are often found in the most dangerous places. Knowing when to keep searching—and when to escape—is the difference between leaving rich and leaving with nothing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/b9fdbadc1c2242708d3645c006fa77dd.poster.avif?t=1787139131\" width=832 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/b9fdbadc1c2242708d3645c006fa77dd.webm?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/b9fdbadc1c2242708d3645c006fa77dd.mp4?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRUTAL CLOSE-QUARTERS COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords. Spears. Sabers. War fans. Halberds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master an arsenal inspired by centuries of Chinese martial weaponry in intense, close-range battles where timing and positioning matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block incoming attacks. Dodge at the right moment. Counter when your opponent leaves an opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the fight carefully — it's not over until the last breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/8c7b13ad928991e3944b448980c8b4fe.poster.avif?t=1787139131\" width=832 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/8c7b13ad928991e3944b448980c8b4fe.webm?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/8c7b13ad928991e3944b448980c8b4fe.mp4?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN COMBAT STYLE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from distinct combat archetypes inspired by Chinese folklore, each offering a different way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control enchanted objects. Break through enemy defenses with raw force. Strike from concealment. Outmaneuver opponents through planning and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities, weapons, and tactics to create a playstyle that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thousand paths through the blight. How you break the deadlock is yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/6f24e384875fc0313cb7d5739edc39d7.poster.avif?t=1787139131\" width=832 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/6f24e384875fc0313cb7d5739edc39d7.webm?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4354610/extras/6f24e384875fc0313cb7d5739edc39d7.mp4?t=1787139131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Greed or Dread: Which will claim you first?​</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tamas: Shadowveil</strong> is a first-person PvPvE extraction game set in a dark world inspired by Chinese folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter haunted ruins armed with cold steel. Search for valuable relics, fight supernatural creatures and rival players, and escape before everything you brought in—and everything you found—is lost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT KIND OF GAME IS IT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a blight-stricken region alongside other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned settlements, search buildings for lost treasures, and fight anything standing between you and the extraction point—whether human, supernatural, or something in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 